<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Web Design · Website Care · SEO</div><h1>Build it.<br><span>Improve it.</span><br>Keep it working.</h1><p class="lead">New website, tired website or a site that simply needs regular attention? LOS combines design, practical website care and local SEO so the digital side of your business doesn't stop at launch.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="#contact">Discuss your website ↗</a><a class="btn" href="#care">Explore website care ↓</a></div></div><div class="hero-visual reveal"><img src="los-restaurant-interior.jpg" alt="Modern restaurant interior"><div class="device-mock"><div class="laptop"><div class="screen"><span>LOS WEB</span><strong>Designed for<br>real business.</strong><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="phone"><div class="phone-top"></div><span>LOS</span><b>Mobile<br>first.</b><i></i><i></i></div></div><b class="visual-label">Responsive design · desktop + mobile</b></div></div></section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="top reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">Website design</div><h2>Start fresh or improve what you already have.</h2></div><p>LOS doesn't rebuild a website just for the sake of it. The right approach depends on what is already working and what is holding the business back.</p></div><div class="choices"><article class="choice reveal"><div class="choice-head"><span class="choice-no">01</span><span class="round-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 18V6h16v12H4zM7 9h10M7 12h7"/><path d="m15 17 5-5M17 12h3v3"/></svg></span></div><h3>Redesign my website</h3><p>Modernise an existing site without throwing away everything that already works.</p><div class="tags"><span>Mobile layout</span><span>Navigation</span><span>Speed</span><span>Content</span><span>SEO structure</span></div><a href="#contact">Discuss a redesign <b>↗</b></a></article><article class="choice dark reveal"><div class="choice-head"><span class="choice-no">02</span><span class="round-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="1"/><path d="M12 7v10M7 12h10"/></svg></span></div><h3>Build something new</h3><p>A responsive website built around the business, its customer journey and what needs to happen after someone lands on the page.</p><div class="tags"><span>Responsive build</span><span>Enquiries</span><span>Bookings</span><span>Menus</span><span>Google-ready</span></div><a href="#contact">Start a new website <b>↗</b></a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark" id="care"><div class="container split"><div class="reveal"><div class="eyebrow">LOS Website Care</div><h2>Your website shouldn't be forgotten after launch.</h2><p class="care-copy">Restaurants and small businesses change constantly. Menus move, prices change, opening hours change and promotions come and go. LOS can keep the website current without every small change becoming a project.</p><a class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:#111;border-color:#fff" href="#contact">Ask about website care ↗</a></div><div class="care-grid reveal"><article class="care"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h16v12H4zM8 3v6M16 3v6"/></svg><h3>Regular updates</h3><p>Menus, prices, opening hours, promotions, banners and content changes.</p></article><article class="care"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 18 9 12l4 4 8-9M17 7h4v4"/></svg><h3>Performance checks</h3><p>Keep an eye on mobile presentation, broken links and obvious speed issues.</p></article><article class="care"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6"/><path d="m15 15 5 5"/></svg><h3>SEO housekeeping</h3><p>Page titles, descriptions, content structure and local search improvements.</p></article><article class="care"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg><h3>Practical support</h3><p>Help with domains, website changes, business email and everyday digital problems.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="audit-band"><div class="container audit-grid"><div class="audit-copy reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Website health check</div><h2>See what needs attention before spending money.</h2><p>LOS can review the mobile experience, content, local search basics and customer journey, then focus on improvements that matter.</p><div class="audit-pills"><span>Mobile</span><span>Speed</span><span>SEO</span><span>Content</span><span>Bookings</span></div></div><div class="audit-ui reveal"><div class="audit-top"><b>LOS Website Check</b><span>Example review</span></div><div class="audit-row"><div><b>Mobile experience</b><small>Layout · navigation · calls to action</small></div><span class="score good">Good</span></div><div class="audit-row"><div><b>Local visibility</b><small>Search structure · Google signals</small></div><span class="score improve">Improve</span></div><div class="audit-row"><div><b>Content accuracy</b><small>Menus · hours · contact information</small></div><span class="score good">Good</span></div><div class="audit-row"><div><b>Conversion journey</b><small>Enquiry · booking · customer action</small></div><span class="score improve">Review</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section soft seo-compact" id="seo"><div class="container"><div class="seo-split"><div class="seo-intro reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Local SEO & visibility</div><h2>Be easier to find. Easier to choose.</h2><p>LOS focuses on practical local visibility: clear pages, accurate business information and a website that helps Google and customers understand what you offer.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Improve my visibility <b>↗</b></a></div><div class="seo-list reveal"><article><span class="seo-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s7-5.2 7-12a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 6.8 7 12 7 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"/></svg></span><div><h3>Local presence</h3><p>Business details, location signals, menu and booking links kept clear and consistent.</p></div></article><article><span class="seo-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6"/><path d="m15 15 5 5M7 10h6"/></svg></span><div><h3>On-page SEO</h3><p>Titles, descriptions, headings, copy, image alt text and internal links improved where useful.</p></div></article><article><span class="seo-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 18V6M4 18h16M8 15l3-4 3 2 5-6"/><path d="M16 7h3v3"/></svg></span><div><h3>Search insight</h3><p>Use Search Console data to spot indexing problems and pages worth improving.</p></div></article></div></div></div></section>
